      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارغثتهُ</span></b> , said of a ewe, (S,) [and app. of a
she-goat also, (see 1,) or of any female,] <i>She
suckled him;</i> (S, K;) namely, her young one. (S.)
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَغُوثٌ</span>. ＝   
